---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import siteConfig from '../data/site.config.json';
---
<BaseLayout title={`Privacy policy | ${siteConfig.siteName}`} description="Privacy policy">
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 1.5rem; max-width: 720px;">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>This policy covers the personal data collected through the contact/quote forms on this website.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you submit a quote request, we collect the name, phone number, email address, project details and postcode you provide, along with the page (city and service) you submitted it from.</p>
    <h2>How it's used</h2>
    <p>This information is used solely to match you with 2-3 vetted local specialists so they can quote for your job. It is not sold to third parties beyond that quote-matching purpose, and it is never used for cold-calling outside of the specific quote you asked for.</p>
    <h2>Form processing</h2>
    <p>Our quote form is embedded from leads.work, an independent lead-matching platform we use to route enquiries to vetted specialists. Data entered in the form is transmitted to and processed by leads.work under their own privacy policy.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>This site uses Matomo, a privacy-friendly analytics tool, with IP anonymisation and no cross-site tracking. It does not currently use third-party advertising cookies.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>To ask about the data we hold or request its deletion, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
